                <syl /><neume facs="#m-e59ebe55-9dea-41ca-bcdc-5df594b8ea0c" type="punctum" xml:id="m-632f7b22-0ce3-41b4-8fae-39a164fe2544">
                  <nc xml:id="m-2733b7fc-8a4d-4405-ba94-c8b07f8c4d01" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-ce87d4ec-30a1-4716-b542-525297a9c1c1" facs="#m-c637a66a-2147-4a14-88be-3401d173d1d3" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-44487305-44ac-4a98-9697-6479fffc566e"><lg xml:id="m-50191718-7f23-4642-a906-ca842e9d3dca"><l xml:id="m-f45ea8f7-f073-485a-9fcb-ff0013562411" facs="#m-f31cd588-4cf3-4053-a19a-fe5e6efc24f9" label="text-like">In Honour of the Blessed Virgin Mary.</l><l xml:id="m-65facc7b-e9cb-4c67-a2a1-7c90882d46e0" facs="#m-1696798c-d936-4095-afd9-f054321e4ed0" label="ambiguous">1859</l><l xml:id="m-d90bd8a6-6304-4aa2-ab6c-26c0d749884d" facs="#m-3b50715b-1b6b-4a87-9347-08c876f7243a" label="lyrics-like">V. Ora pro nóbis sáncta Déi Génitrix.</l><l xml:id="m-a51458d9-2de8-4bb1-a8aa-2b0735cb4a76" facs="#m-5b32941b-ee56-4567-b60b-f4626e209f73" label="lyrics-like">R. Ut digni efficiámur promissiónibus Christi.</l><l xml:id="m-bd39188d-7ac6-4534-a974-5090e4846ca2" facs="#m-1410db4b-85c8-4986-a59b-e40be8fc0fad" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-1c634b32-4461-429f-928a-319a39ef798e" facs="#m-ac2dc23b-f86e-4ae2-9c41-42972970c800" label="lyrics-like">VOncéde nos fámulos tuos, quaé- semper Virginis intercessióne, *a</l><l xml:id="m-174ced4c-da16-4bd5-9bf4-441513a169c2" facs="#m-d1c3b760-dd9c-4b82-b39a-15b8b2df19bc" label="lyrics-like">Lsumus Dómine Deus, perpétua! praesénti liberári tristitia, et aetérna</l><l xml:id="m-e3b404f9-ab9b-4a86-8a42-ac0fa5f9d55c" facs="#m-66a3d7dd-b80f-4410-8865-8b83e0968731" label="lyrics-like">mentis et córporis sanitáte gaudé- pérfrui laetítia. Per Christum Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-2275c247-affa-4fe7-8cf9-e6ac4474c589" facs="#m-fb2d0a58-bb0d-4db3-88ae-96235a8d1616" label="lyrics-like">re: t et gloriósa beá̂tae Mariae minum nostrum. E. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-bd5530e6-0808-4d53-a383-faf80f3a59c7" facs="#m-09c9cb41-79b7-454f-a0ca-96ccd46b34f0" label="ambiguous">During Advent:</l><l xml:id="m-c496181e-1ba1-44cb-9c3a-de48fba835be" facs="#m-177c60fb-76f1-4164-a36c-7c5c4b1e2f1a" label="lyrics-like">V. Angelus Dómini nuntiávit Maríae.</l><l xml:id="m-1fafffcf-cfa5-4184-b75e-ae4a4edbb562" facs="#m-499ce940-e4cc-4950-9f06-cd4733fe29ee" label="lyrics-like">K. Et concépit de Spiritu Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-b62cd48c-c8e4-49c7-8251-b0a655ec87e5" facs="#m-96869d10-5133-4a43-af97-c68932767abe" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-447facfe-73a7-4adb-85f2-5b2edb16f0cb" facs="#m-c4419771-25ec-457f-8872-e3bb3ff2581b" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui de beátae Maríae Vírgi-] qui vere eam Genitricem Dei crédi¬</l><l xml:id="m-9c6c1049-f79d-4a51-aa26-bb2d83f969db" facs="#m-c652d2b2-bd89-456a-a95b-735af9bbb6a6" label="lyrics-like">Unis útero Verbum tuum, Angelo mus, * ejus apud te intercessiónibus</l><l xml:id="m-17d53d1d-d315-4ea4-8176-5eb8848b43d3" facs="#m-4d72569e-cfe0-419b-b0a8-a4e50ef98ca5" label="lyrics-like">nuntiánte, carnem suscípere volui- adjuvémur. Per eúmdem Christum</l><l xml:id="m-dabbb8ee-a77f-4fd1-8fff-515d5d4403ff" facs="#m-beec29bc-6be0-4f20-9bc2-09ff5e38d88f" label="lyrics-like">sti:t praesta supplicibus tuis; ut, Dóminum nostrum. K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-7f41d894-9aed-4a8b-95e8-def787ecdbb9" facs="#m-a72201e2-b2ad-4fab-83d8-04c0b49bf0e2" label="text-like">At Christmastide:</l><l xml:id="m-cda257c1-1acd-4c99-bd65-7ed704103303" facs="#m-6e6d44f9-3d63-468e-8b48-e9f9b7bd2014" label="lyrics-like">V. Post pártum, Virgo, invioláta permansísti.</l><l xml:id="m-4d26c95c-c6ec-413b-94ed-ac84f638efc9" facs="#m-bdb26ab2-0744-4a69-8c74-859a4456a3e0" label="lyrics-like">F. Déi Génitrix, intercéde pro nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-92d0264a-de46-4524-bf74-484775536087" facs="#m-aa1140cc-27d4-4c0d-a59b-3a8173704186" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-dc63aaca-434a-455a-b450-29305e3a7ec0" facs="#m-58c2b412-d020-4999-8686-991d34584c2b" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui salútis aetérnae, beátae  nobis intercédere sentiámus, *per</l><l xml:id="m-65081950-013a-45ed-9529-208e9f30eade" facs="#m-181facbf-e542-4556-8821-6025ef5dffb4" label="lyrics-like">I Marsae virginitáte fecúnda, hu-quam merúimus auctórem vitae</l><l xml:id="m-059e2645-efeb-463d-a54c-f13418260165" facs="#m-75468a10-099f-41b9-b174-c9543c7db6d1" label="lyrics-like">máno géneri praémia praestitisti:t suscipere, Dóminum nostrum Jesum</l><l xml:id="m-98500a15-a286-4aac-b35b-ef5186f236d7" facs="#m-674cb406-f6d3-46ce-8942-ae0ea4de14ad" label="lyrics-like">tribue, quaésumus; ut ipsam pro! Christum Filium tuum. R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-9f730f24-b99d-4c6f-ac98-49a7aca28635" facs="#m-b4748846-f9d8-4ad7-87ee-8f5716a2982a" label="text-like">In Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-51a4b240-2962-4665-bafc-5e5724a2978e" facs="#m-79a0fa05-395b-4885-98d9-140701be1222" label="lyrics-like">V. Gáude et laetáre, Virgo María, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-bc5871da-c974-4d97-9764-02ba95d3c8ab" facs="#m-c33d0ae1-7e56-43bb-875e-9974942a7fa6" label="lyrics-like">R. Quia surréxit Dóminus vere, alleluia.</l><l xml:id="m-9bc89b2f-1d27-4571-8220-4234ea2a5dcb" facs="#m-a30fff29-13bf-48a1-940a-d8a71c6d5445" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-cd7f1dfe-cc08-4da5-9a01-7ea3ff49e9de" facs="#m-5eb345b8-3f2c-4f1d-83c4-89b73a23c377" label="lyrics-like">AEus, qui per resurrectiónem Fi¬ nitrícem Virginem Maríam* per¬</l><l xml:id="m-15a891ee-34ce-49cd-8111-5c3a761fd325" facs="#m-5fdd4c12-ee4f-4c92-93d3-6c58baed9e85" label="lyrics-like">I lii tui Dómini nostri Jesu Christi pétuae capiámus gáudia vitae. Per</l><l xml:id="m-02fb8029-cd26-4cc9-88a9-16f7362e7129" facs="#m-71038389-8095-49a6-b6b4-1bd344cae237" label="lyrics-like">mundum laetificáre dignátus es: t eúmdem Christum Dóminum no¬</l><l xml:id="m-102a1028-0105-43b2-96f8-889785cd967b" facs="#m-4e6afae7-7a43-4c3d-9cda-c5d20b5b9a58" label="lyrics-like">praesta, quaésumus; ut per ejus Ge- strum. K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-b4b4dc6c-b268-4837-9917-57eee790fdc6" facs="#m-4551fb4c-14ec-4312-9a46-9babd24f567e" label="ambiguous">Another Chant."</l><l xml:id="m-c997a564-431c-49d5-af46-c36421c2096d" facs="#m-6883fc31-c61a-4dbc-89e2-d4ad69dc23bc" label="lyrics-like">Yri-e e-lé-i-son. ij. Chríste e-lé-i-son. ij. Ky-ri-e</l><l xml:id="m-ba7420b8-7445-4eb2-9aa8-2cc0a0b3f6f8" facs="#m-53bd12c9-3317-4dee-9e7f-419a2e40f7ba" label="lyrics-like">e-lé-i-son. ij. Chríste áudi nos. 1j. Chríste exáudi nos. ij.</l><l xml:id="m-d4de44ac-73a2-40b2-802f-1dcea017088b" facs="#m-0c7136ac-00f1-412b-9e4b-bc21c0d26769" label="lyrics-like">Pá- ter de caé¬ lis</l><l xml:id="m-9738387f-111e-4802-a61b-569db91e33e4" facs="#m-84caa43a-6f2f-46f7-9dda-b2c3fa6bb284" label="lyrics-like">Dé-us, mi-se-ré-re nó-bis.</l><l xml:id="m-7102c5a3-9f76-4c1f-91f7-155c4cb23b16" facs="#m-c6547f22-2366-4d1a-a301-7ceb5f4a57bc" label="lyrics-like">FÍ- li Redémptor múndi Dé-us, mi-se-ré-re nó-bis.</l><l xml:id="m-b3c7d6aa-b23f-46b0-9dbe-5fd2b447a06b" facs="#m-145f354d-eeff-4787-a294-5a84233e2017" label="lyrics-like">Spí-ri-tus Sáncte</l><l xml:id="m-8d415651-87f0-46eb-ab7e-6ae75715772d" facs="#m-b0d62938-cb09-4b47-8085-29c32951d36f" label="lyrics-like">Dé-us, mi-se-ré-re nó-bis.</l><l xml:id="m-1079cce5-d601-47d1-bed8-057e9692997d" facs="#m-fdda71fa-9a31-428e-a7c2-bf42af34c22f" label="lyrics-like">Dé-us, mi-se-ré-re nó-bis.</l><l xml:id="m-669c2a51-2f01-44d1-bedd-746bff0e3718" facs="#m-273c4ce5-a3ae-42b7-a235-7a27bfce46c7" label="lyrics-like">Sáncta Tríni- tas únus</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>